      heading: "Go-live checklist before your first Amazon.ae order",
      paragraphs: [
        `Work through every line below with a real order rather than a test record. The sign-off table lower down is what we tick off with you; this is the version your operations lead should keep.`,
        `The items most often missed are operational: nobody has decided who checks the channel on a Saturday, dispatch cut-offs have not been written down anywhere, and the person who approves a price change is on leave in the first week.`,
      ],
